        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-57028\"><b>Laurey 57028, Transitional Newport Cabinet Knob in Satin Nickel</b></a>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Newport Collection Knob features a beautiful satin nickel bronze finish. This Transitional Newport Cabinet Knob comes packaged with mounting hardware. A simple kitchen cabinet knob, the 1-3/8 Knob Newport in Satin Nickel is sleek and stunning.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis transitional cabinet knob is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=Laurey+Newport\">Laurey Newport Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey 57028 1-3/8\" Knob Newport Satin Nickel:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Nickel</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1.02\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screw and 1-1/2\" long #8-32 screw.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 finishes:</b>\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#LAU-57028\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-57028-SM.jpg?v=1704354616\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" alt=\"LAU-57028\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/newport-oil-rubbed-bronze-knob-laurey-57066\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-57066-SM.jpg?v=1704354615\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" alt=\"LAU-57066\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/newport-matte-black-knob-laurey-57020\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-57020-SM.jpg?v=1704354615\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" alt=\"LAU-57020\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/newport-polished-chrome-knob-laurey-57026\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-57026-SM.jpg?v=1704354616\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" alt=\"LAU-57026\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/newport-satin-brass-knob-laurey-57004\"><img src=\"https:/